# Replace @your-github-handle with the repository owner's account before enabling
# "Require review from Code Owners" in the branch ruleset.
#
# Until it is replaced, GitHub treats these entries as invalid owners and the
# Code Owners requirement silently does nothing — the status checks still gate.

*                       @your-github-handle

# The public contract and the CI configuration are the two places where a
# mistake is expensive for every plugin, so they are called out explicitly.
/sdk/                   @your-github-handle
/.github/               @your-github-handle
/scripts/               @your-github-handle
